OL,3,CProgramme listings for TUE 24 FEB
OL,4,G1600FComposer of the Week: Amy Beach
OL,5,     GDonald explores the story behind
OL,6,     Gthe 'first Symphony by an
OL,7,     GAmerican woman' - Amy Beach's
OL,8,     G'Gaelic' Symphony of 1897.
OL,9,G1700FIn Tune
OL,10,     GTim Garland and Geoffrey Keezer
OL,11,     Gplay live and Katie chats to
OL,12,     Gconductor Kevin John Edusei.
OL,13,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,14,     GTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,15,     Gsoundscape of classical music.
OL,16,G1930FRadio 3 in Concert
OL,17,     GAdam Hickox conducts the BBC
OL,18,     GPhilharmonic Orchestra in
OL,19,     GRachmaninov's Symphonic Dances.
OL,20,     GElisabeth Brauss joins them for
OL,21,     GRavel's Piano Concerto in G.
