OL,3,CProgramme listings for TUE 24 FEB
OL,4,G2145FThe Essay: Full Moon on Progress
OL,5,     FStreet - series 2
OL,6,     GDr Rommi Smith examines the music
OL,7,     Gand contributions of five leading
OL,8,     GBlack female musicians, to civil
OL,9,     Grights and social change.
OL,10,G2200FNight Tracks
OL,11,     GSara Mohr-Pietsch presents an
OL,12,     Gadventurous, immersive soundtrack
OL,13,     Gfor late-night listening, from
OL,14,     Gclassical to contemporary and
OL,15,     Geverything in between.
OL,16,G2330F'Round Midnight
OL,17,     GSoweto is joined once again by
OL,18,     Ghis guest this week, Aaron Parks,
OL,19,     Gwho has another album to share
OL,20,     Gthat has inspired him.
